          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ঢেউ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঢেউ — ḍheu — \"a wave\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বড় একটা ঢেউ এসে নৌকাটা উল্টে দিল। bôṛo ekṭā ḍheu ese noukāṭā ulṭe dilô. A big wave came and overturned the boat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঢেউ (ḍheu) is filed in CDIAL 5580 under a Middle Indo-Aryan ḍhappa-, 'lump', where a Bengali ḍheu, 'a swelling', appears; how it became a wave is not set out there. It opens with ঢ, the breathy ḍh."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
